0eancia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af43-78fc-b62f-1f35dbc9d115","description":"Vermelho, branco e azul","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7696-9c92-2d54bde4f76e","description":"Verde, branco e vermelho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-768b-94a5-0810953208ec","description":"amarelo, branco e azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7c3c-a5ef-e7975d88b059","description":"vermelho, branco e amarelo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-70fe-9927-a7dba1040101","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Que tipo de calend\u00e1rio \u00e9 usado para contar os dias que faltam at\u00e9 o Natal e costuma ter uma guloseima atr\u00e1s de cada janelinha?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Advento tem, tradicionalmente, 24 portinhas numeradas, que s\u00e3o abertas uma por dia, de 1\u00ba de dezembro at\u00e9 a v\u00e9spera de Natal. As vers\u00f5es modernas podem esconder brinquedos ou atividades em vez de doces.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7582-8a34-9c132eabf75a","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Advento","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7307-b97f-eb942e373a66","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio sagrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-746e-9e1a-f9664c7678f2","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio do Kwanzaa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7462-a56b-ba48e30bb12d","description":"Um calend\u00e1rio de contagem regressiva","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-79cb-a0c2-4f7b78620e2d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual dessas cores \u00e9 tradicionalmente associada ao Natal?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O vermelho aparece com destaque nas bagas do azevinho e em muitas representa\u00e7\u00f5es do Papai Noel, o que contribui para torn\u00e1-lo uma cor natalina familiar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7c51-b325-c9a9a7bb436d","description":"Vermelho","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7ceb-8c3d-7eeec911a5ff","description":"Laranja","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7288-9d93-5983e1814746","description":"Azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af43-7b49-b831-c8da39dd1631","description":"Roxo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7238-b55f-a8491d45d942","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Com qual das op\u00e7\u00f5es a seguir os totens s\u00e3o mais comumente associados?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os totens s\u00e3o associados \u00e0s culturas ind\u00edgenas, embora as tradi\u00e7\u00f5es variem amplamente entre os povos ind\u00edgenas; alguns povos da Costa Noroeste, por exemplo, esculpem totens ligados \u00e0s hist\u00f3rias familiares.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af44-79b3-afed-b89aafdd7d90","description":"Culturas ind\u00edgenas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-77ec-9e25-11aee367a7d7","description":"Empresas modernas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7786-9bb7-3e12eda3af44","description":"Cidades-estado da Gr\u00e9cia Antiga","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7c57-bbd3-0e8a75c52780","description":"Guildas da Europa medieval","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7cda-9245-c3a18b8ec1ff","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c16-9b72-2e444808bbc8","question":"Qual \u00e9 a cor tradicional associada ao Dia de S\u00e3o Patr\u00edcio?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O verde est\u00e1 associado ao trevo e ao apelido da Irlanda, a Ilha Esmeralda. Usar essa cor \u00e9 um costume popular no Dia de S\u00e3o Patr\u00edcio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7fd6-82a0-300cb12f3f99","description":"Verde","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7b0e-a2b3-95d16bc12d3d","description":"Azul","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-71f4-b56a-52063e25bf8e","description":"Vermelho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-7fae-817d-7f58df25b065","description":"Amarelo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af44-71b7-a6aa-788ab54b8c43","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7c1